# Timers, boundary events (interrupting and not), event-based gateway.
# covers: §6.1, §7.2, §10
title "Support ticket"

start message Ticket raised
user Triage ticket
  on timer 4 hours [non-interrupting] -> send Notify team lead -> end Lead notified
user Resolve ticket
  on timer 2 days
    user Specialist investigation
    # open interrupting boundary chain: merges back after "Resolve ticket"
send Ask customer to confirm
event Wait for customer
  - catch message Customer confirms
  - catch message Customer reopens -> Resolve ticket
  - wait 7 days
end Ticket closed
